---
// InfoStrip - Fast highlights banner under Hero from fuckfuck.html with Orange theme
---

<div class="info-strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="strip-item"><span>06 MIN</span>本庄駅より徒歩6分</div>
    <div class="strip-item"><span>FREE</span>見学・無料体験受付中</div>
    <div class="strip-item"><span>PARKING</span>無料駐車場あり</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .info-strip {
    background: #ff6b00;
    color: #141613;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .info-strip .wrap {
    width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }

  .strip-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 22px 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(20, 22, 19, 0.2);
  }

  .strip-item:first-child {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(20, 22, 19, 0.2);
  }

  .strip-item span {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .info-strip .wrap {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .strip-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 16px 4px;
      font-size: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .strip-item span {
      font-size: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
